      "parameters": [],
      "implementation": "crates/pal-vm/src/input.rs",
      "notes": "Returns the signed16 wheel latch. Windows positive wheel delta becomes -1; negative becomes +1. The last queued wheel message wins, then the engine clears the latch after its frame callback. Export itself does not consume the latch. Magnitude is normalized by the window procedure; multiple events are not summed. A zero Windows delta follows the nonnegative branch and becomes -1.",
